sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant PC as PC dashboard
  participant ADB as Local ADB bridge
  participant Phone as Phone browser
  participant RX as PC collector
  participant Disk as PC files
  User->>PC: Select USB, token and authorized device
  PC->>RX: POST /api/usb (local admin only)
  RX->>ADB: Verify USB and reverse port mapping
  ADB-->>RX: Mapping confirmed
  PC->>RX: Create session (usb-adb)
  RX-->>PC: Session ID and upload-only key
  PC-->>Phone: QR with localhost origin and pairing fragment
  User->>Phone: Check sensors
  Phone-->>User: Observed availability, rates, permission warning
  User->>Phone: Continue to capture
  Phone->>RX: Clock exchanges and device capabilities
  loop While capturing
    Phone->>RX: Batched telemetry and indexed JPEG
    RX->>Disk: Append records and write JPEG
    Disk-->>RX: Writes completed
    RX-->>Phone: Acceptance or storage ACK
    PC->>RX: Latest saved image and selected sensor chart
    RX-->>PC: Newest JPEG, metrics and samples
  end
  User->>Phone: Stop capture and flush
  User->>PC: Stop and save
  PC->>RX: Finalize session
  RX->>Disk: Completed manifest
